{"addedOn":10,"avgRating":["fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o"],"breadcrumbsHtml":"<a href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117\">OpenEdge Development: ABL Reference</a>\n<span><i class=\"fa fa-angle-right\"></i>\n</span>\n<a href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/ABL-Syntax-Reference.html\">ABL Syntax Reference</a>\n<span><i class=\"fa fa-angle-right\"></i>\n</span>\n<span class=\"active\">OR operator (logical)</span>\n","class":"manual","created":1226,"dislikeurl":"https://docs-be.progress.com/dislike/310209","html":"<article class=\"hascomments\" data-page=\"bundle:openedge-abl-reference-117/enus/OR-operator-logical.html\" id=\"bundle:openedge-abl-reference-117/enus/OR-operator-logical.html\"><main role=\"main\"><article aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\" class=\"dita\" id=\"OR-operator-logical\" role=\"article\">\n  <h1 class=\"title topictitle1 reference\" id=\"ariaid-title1\">OR operator (logical)</h1>\n  \n  <div class=\"body refbody\">\n    <section class=\"section\" id=\"OR-operator-logical__section_N10024_N10021_N10001\">\n      <p class=\"p\">Returns a TRUE value if either of two logical\nexpressions is TRUE.</p>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"section\" id=\"OR-operator-logical__syntax_GC19XU2698446\"><h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\" id=\"d116976e96\">Syntax</h2>\n      \n      <table class=\"table frame-all\" id=\"OR-operator-logical__idGDN2OF2673589\"><caption></caption><colgroup><col style=\"width:100%\" /></colgroup><tbody class=\"tbody\">\n            <tr class=\"row rowsep-0\">\n              <td class=\"entry colsep-1 rowsep-1\">\n                <pre class=\"pre codeblock\"><code><var class=\"keyword varname\">expression</var> OR <var class=\"keyword varname\">expression</var></code></pre>\n              </td>\n            </tr>\n          </tbody></table>\n      <dl class=\"dl parml\">\n        \n          <dt class=\"dt pt dlterm\"><var class=\"keyword varname\">expression</var></dt>\n          <dd class=\"dd pd\">A logical expression (a constant, field name, variable name or\n            expression whose value is logical, that is, TRUE/FALSE, YES/NO). </dd>\n        \n      </dl>\n      <div class=\"note note note_note\" id=\"OR-operator-logical__note_N10082_N1002F_N10021_N10001\"><span class=\"note__title\">Note:</span> It is possible for an operand to\n        evaluate to the Unknown value (<code class=\"ph codeph\">?</code>). For an\n          <code class=\"ph codeph\">OR</code> operation, the result is TRUE if either operand evaluates to TRUE\n        (even if one of the operands is the Unknown value (<code class=\"ph codeph\">?</code>)). In all other cases,\n        the result is the Unknown value (<code class=\"ph codeph\">?</code>) if an operand evaluates to the Unknown\n        value (<code class=\"ph codeph\">?</code>).</div>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"section\" id=\"OR-operator-logical__example_GC19XV2698452\"><h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\" id=\"d116976e157\">Example</h2>\n      \n      <p class=\"p\">This\nprocedure lists Customers who have no postal code (<code class=\"ph codeph\">PostalCode\n= &quot;&quot;</code>) or that have no telephone number (<code class=\"ph codeph\">Phone</code> =\n&quot;&quot;), and displays how many Customers are in the list:</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">\n        <strong class=\"ph b\">r-or.p</strong>\n      </p>\n      <table class=\"table frame-all\" id=\"OR-operator-logical__idGDN2OG2673595\"><caption></caption><colgroup><col style=\"width:100%\" /></colgroup><tbody class=\"tbody\">\n            <tr class=\"row rowsep-0\">\n              <td class=\"entry colsep-1 rowsep-1\">\n                <pre class=\"pre codeblock\"><code>FOR EACH Customer NO-LOCK \n  WHERE <strong class=\"ph b\">Customer.PostalCode = &quot;&quot; OR Customer.Phone = &quot;&quot;:</strong>\n  DISPLAY Customer.CustNum Customer.Name (COUNT) Customer.City Customer.State\n    Customer.PostalCode Customer.Phone.\nEND.</code></pre>\n              </td>\n            </tr>\n          </tbody></table>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"section\" id=\"OR-operator-logical__see-also_GC19XW2698461\"><h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\" id=\"d116976e201\">See also</h2>\n      \n      <p class=\"p\">\n        <a class=\"xref\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"AND-operator-logical.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/AND-operator-logical.html\">AND operator (logical)</a>, <a class=\"xref\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"NOT-operator-logical.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/NOT-operator-logical.html\">NOT operator (logical)</a></p>\n    </section>\n  </div>\n<nav role=\"navigation\"><div class=\"familylinks\"><div class=\"previouslink\"><strong>Previous topic:</strong> <a class=\"link\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"OR-operator-bitwise.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/OR-operator-bitwise.html\">OR operator (bitwise)</a></div><div class=\"nextlink\"><strong>Next topic:</strong> <a class=\"link\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"OS-APPEND-statement.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/OS-APPEND-statement.html\">OS-APPEND statement</a></div></div></nav><nav class=\"related-links\" role=\"navigation\"></nav></article></main></article>\n","isWatched":false,"labelText":"Product; Product > OpenEdge; Product > OpenEdge > Version 11.7; Format; Format > Documentation","likes":0,"likeurl":"https://docs-be.progress.com/like/310209","myDocsURL":null,"numOfPageViews":0,"numOfRatingsText":"<span>0 Ratings","revised":1222,"showWatch":false,"topicMeta":[["bookowner","oe11docs"],["bookrights","oe11docs"],["bundle","openedge-abl-reference-117"],["data","OEInformationHub/Product"],["data","OEInformationHub/Product/product_openedge"],["data","OEInformationHub/Product/product_openedge/product_openedge_117"],["data","OEInformationHub/format"],["data","OEInformationHub/format/format_documentation"],["organization","oe11docs"]],"topicTitle":"OR operator (logical)","topicurl":"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/OR-operator-logical.html","type":"Manual"}